OL,3,GNEWSAPregnant abuse survivor 'scared'
OL,4,Ain shared housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pregnant domestic abuse survivor has
OL,7,Fsaid she had to share bathrooms with
OL,8,Fintoxicated men in a council's
OL,9,Ftemporary accommodation.
OL,11,FThe woman, who had to flee her home
OL,12,Fwith her young baby, said she was
OL,13,Fplaced in shared, mixed accommodation
OL,14,Fwith no private washing or cooking
OL,15,Fareas in Northumberland.
OL,17,FShe said she was chased down the
OL,18,Fcorridor by an intoxicated male, was
OL,19,Fforced to barricade herself in her
OL,20,Froom, and said there was no separate
OL,21,Fbed for her child.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
