OL,3,GNEWSAPregnant abuse survivor 'scared'
OL,4,Ain shared housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthumberland County Council said it
OL,7,Fhad offered the woman the opportunity
OL,8,Fto move from her current property and
OL,9,Fwas working closely with her, with a
OL,10,Fplan to relocate her to permanent
OL,11,Faccommodation in the coming weeks.
